{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Justice Became Prey",
    "steam_appid": 3791940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up and everything is in its place \u2014 your family, your home, your hopes, and your peace.\u00a0Then, someone who has lost their humanity \u2014 and with it, all their values \u2014 comes and rips away your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have two choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give up and accept your helplessness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fight for your life and your hopes?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Story-Driven FPS Gameplay</strong>: A blend of action and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Emotional Narrative</strong>: Themes of justice, regret, inner journey, and personal reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Stealth or Action</strong>: Dive headfirst into the action or take the silent path through stealth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Sound &amp; Music</strong>: Music that enhances and supports the storytelling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosives, knives, guns, bullets, endless sand, pain, destruction, and corrupted souls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this game focuses more on emotions than weapons, on silence more than explosions, and on inner reckoning rather than rage.<br>If you're looking for a meaningful first-person shooter experience with a powerful story, this journey is made for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up and everything is in its place \u2014 your family, your home, your hopes, and your peace.\u00a0Then, someone who has lost their humanity \u2014 and with it, all their values \u2014 comes and rips away your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have two choices:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give up and accept your helplessness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fight for your life and your hopes?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Story-Driven FPS Gameplay</strong>: A blend of action and narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Emotional Narrative</strong>: Themes of justice, regret, inner journey, and personal reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Stealth or Action</strong>: Dive headfirst into the action or take the silent path through stealth gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Sound &amp; Music</strong>: Music that enhances and supports the storytelling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosives, knives, guns, bullets, endless sand, pain, destruction, and corrupted souls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this game focuses more on emotions than weapons, on silence more than explosions, and on inner reckoning rather than rage.<br>If you're looking for a meaningful first-person shooter experience with a powerful story, this journey is made for you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Ali, who lives an ordinary life, loses all the happiness and peace he once had in a single day. And with a glimmer of hope, he begins searching for the peace he can no longer find in this world \u2014 for himself and his little sister.",
